Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.96,0:00:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.24,0:00:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.36,0:00:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.92,0:00:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that can't be beaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.98,0:00:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.58,0:00:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past every wall that's\Nin our wake, go without hesitation!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.76,0:00:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.86,0:00:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to press on a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.70,0:00:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,To get to the answers we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.28,0:00:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We came to this new world believing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.38,0:00:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That surely someday we\Njust might find the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All the pieces of our dreams\Nhave now come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Our bonds won't waver.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.44,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,With our dreaming hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on towards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.66,0:00:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A bright new future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.78,0:00:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.62,0:00:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.68,0:01:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.30,0:01:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.50,0:01:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past everyone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.40,0:01:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on, never stopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.68,0:01:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.42,0:01:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your head up way up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.42,0:01:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Always step up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.12,0:01:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If waves are rough, jump to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.08,0:01:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.88,0:01:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Our wishes, they will come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.86,0:01:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And lead us on for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.66,0:01:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We drift on riding the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.92,0:01:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Towards another shore day by day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There are many meetings, many goodbyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.58,0:01:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Underneath the flag we fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.06,0:01:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll remember the pain within.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep it in my heart forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.94,0:01:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And never take it lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.08,0:01:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But I won't surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.92,0:01:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This freedom I will keep in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.12,0:01:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep holding on, never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.74,0:01:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.52,0:01:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.60,0:02:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.26,0:02:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.42,0:02:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.96,0:02:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past everyone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.32,0:02:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on, never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.96,0:02:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up, keep your\Nhead up, way up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Always step up. If waves\Nare up, jump to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.04,0:02:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up, our wishes,\Nthey will come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.76,0:02:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And lead us on for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.08,0:02:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.34,0:02:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My head is killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.70,0:02:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It must have hit it when\Nwe fell or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.88,0:02:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, perhaps the same thing happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.28,0:02:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,My skull aches terribly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.96,0:02:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We've wasted too much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.82,0:02:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how the samurai's holding up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.20,0:02:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I blame you and this stupid side trip. Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.16,0:02:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it was something\Nwe all agreed on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.30,0:02:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,A shame we weren't able\Nto locate the yeti.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.64,0:02:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we were close.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.30,0:03:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, those shadows we saw seemed\Nquite promising, wouldn't you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.76,0:03:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Those shadows didn't belong to any yeti.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.16,0:03:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You said yourself that\Nit was an enemy attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.12,0:03:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.72,0:03:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you did. No, I did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.94,0:03:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe in the Yeti.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.62,0:03:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I do believe in Yeti.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.36,0:03:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe or disbelieve.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.32,0:03:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I am content to simply\Nponder its existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.44,0:03:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I'm a little\Nimpressed right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.78,0:03:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a pretty mature outlook to have.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.14,0:03:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, wisdom is a benefit of advanced age.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.88,0:03:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I'd call that way of\Nthinking indecisiveness, not wisdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.30,0:03:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This idiot could fall down the\Nwhole damn mountain for all I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.90,0:03:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you don't like me, but at\Nleast treat Nami's body with respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.14,0:03:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you stop bickering for a\Nmoment and come take a look?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.70,0:03:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly, I see a footprint.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.18,0:03:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's enormous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.42,0:03:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.94,0:03:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This footprint.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.92,0:03:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it have been left\Nby the legendary Yeti?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.06,0:03:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.97,0:04:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.96,0:04:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.62,0:04:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, damn. It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.84,0:04:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,There are giant footprints in the snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.22,0:04:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.13,0:04:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.68,0:04:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.02,0:04:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,There are so many of\Nthem, and they look fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.06,0:04:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If we follow them, we may find...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.50,0:04:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,One of nature's greatest mysteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.74,0:04:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like they stop here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.82,0:04:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.60,0:04:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There are two huge shadows behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.08,0:04:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.40,0:04:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think they could be... Yeti?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.56,0:05:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of gas is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.08,0:05:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost as if I'm drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.62,0:05:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I suddenly find it hard to speak\Nclearly and I'm so very tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.18,0:05:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an enemy attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.42,0:05:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't waste your time\Nfighting against the effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.60,0:05:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,KYP leaves you drunk and drowsy\Nno matter how high your tolerance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.18,0:05:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Beneath this cliff lies District F-16.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.56,0:05:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Home to the terrible ice spikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.18,0:05:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Three targets down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.74,0:05:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.74,0:05:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Spikes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.18,0:05:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey guys, any ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.48,0:06:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that was a close call.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.72,0:06:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We have arrived at District F-16.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.18,0:06:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We found three of the\NStraw Hats as reported.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.60,0:06:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We will recover the dead bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.12,0:06:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.08,0:06:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hate to disappoint you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.84,0:06:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, one of them's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.78,0:06:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,She's just a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.04,0:06:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,She won't bite us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.18,0:06:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be so sure if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.14,0:06:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn underlings!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.54,0:06:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to be more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.94,0:06:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami's body is fragile.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.46,0:06:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It probably bruises easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.40,0:06:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to put a\Nsingle scratch on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.36,0:06:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I need a smoke, Nami, my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.30,0:06:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.22,0:06:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.92,0:07:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to wake up, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.86,0:07:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, enough hunting nature's mysteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.22,0:07:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Think the samurai's around here somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.24,0:07:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that would make\Nthe most sense, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.86,0:07:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd imagine he's probably still looking\Nfor his torso in the vicinity of the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.70,0:07:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not far from the water now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.12,0:07:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear us, samurai?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.44,0:07:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.08,0:07:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out, come out, wherever you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.34,0:07:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.58,0:07:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Did someone kick your ass already?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.76,0:07:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to be here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.82,0:07:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.94,0:07:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.85,0:07:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're able, please say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.92,0:07:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I truly thought we would find him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.44,0:07:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows, maybe you found his torso\Nalready and went off to look for his son?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.72,0:08:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, I think this is him! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.72,0:08:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, crap, he's frozen solid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.18,0:08:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.72,0:08:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.24,0:08:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't look too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.66,0:08:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So someone did kick your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.38,0:08:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I suddenly became paralyzed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.72,0:08:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought for certain\Nthat death was upon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.26,0:08:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean you got caught in\Na snowstorm and froze solid?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.94,0:08:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.85,0:08:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The cold cannot touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.14,0:08:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit being so stubborn!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.14,0:08:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A warrior such as I\Ndoes not feel the cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.82,0:08:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's more trouble than he's worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.50,0:08:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Whip up some clothes, or have you\Nalready forgotten your ability?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.24,0:09:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is, the magic, I did\Nnot acquire it without a cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.48,0:09:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of it, I now\Nhave a certain weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.94,0:09:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I will ever since partaking of that\Nfruit, when submerged in water, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.22,0:09:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't swim, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.40,0:09:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.46,0:09:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you see, I believe I\Nmay know where my torso is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.80,0:09:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.71,0:09:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I suspect that you might\Nlocate it somewhere underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.34,0:09:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Underwater?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.76,0:09:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.84,0:09:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels as if the upper\Nhalf of my body is submerged.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.58,0:09:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.76,0:09:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's how you wound up\Nhere, immobilized and frozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.08,0:09:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If your body is underwater,\Nthen you can't use your ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.46,0:09:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You said his torso was near the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.66,0:09:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's stumbling around\Nheadless, it may have fallen in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.70,0:09:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.94,0:09:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And I believe the lake is\Nsalt water rather than fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.96,0:09:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, his other bits are\Nstill alive and kicking,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.24,0:09:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,so I think we can assume it\Nhasn't become shark food yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.22,0:09:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But we have no idea what kind\Nof creatures are in that lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.48,0:09:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We better get it out as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.78,0:09:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.69,0:10:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We should waste no time. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.58,0:10:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear that I must ask if you\Nwould be willing to, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.48,0:10:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Just ask already, damn\Nstubborn samurai. We'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.02,0:10:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But aren't you people pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.32,0:10:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And I am another stranger to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.88,0:10:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So why are you so willing to aid me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.52,0:10:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,When I saved your head, I\Nbecame responsible for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.98,0:10:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.58,0:10:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're back in one\Npiece, we will fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.34,0:10:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And I will kick your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.90,0:10:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.81,0:10:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I accept your aid and your challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.02,0:10:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.34,0:10:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.78,0:10:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at who learned how to say thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.82,0:10:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The cold taught you manners. What
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.20,0:11:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what's that? Oh, it's
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.98,0:11:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,difficult to tell oh those look\Nlike centaurs perhaps the ones
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.54,0:11:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,we robbed Brownbeard subordinates\Nstay with me keep running we
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.80,0:11:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,have to get away from the lake\Nnow and away from the monster that
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.68,0:11:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,appeared on the other side how\Nhas it been hiding on the island
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.40,0:11:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,all this time if we could just\Nmake it to the master he'll know
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.34,0:11:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,what to do save your breath and\Nfocus on running if we slow down
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.52,0:11:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,at all it'll get us what scared of\Na monster aren't you monsters too
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.34,0:11:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,them again those are the pirates\Nwho robbed us damn you're right
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.50,0:11:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,that one's wearing my coat forget\Nabout them just run let's get
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.04,0:11:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,to the lab don't forget they
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.58,0:11:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,kidnapped boss
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.66,0:11:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,what's
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.20,0:11:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,got them so
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.02,0:11:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,worked up they seem to be running\Nfrom something hmm they look scared
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.82,0:12:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,all right and they were coming\Nfrom the lake the one we saw
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.22,0:12:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,earlier right brooke what yes that's\Ncorrect the lake's that way the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.18,0:12:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,same direction we were headed why\Nwhat are you thinking Zoro well
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.18,0:12:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,if it is actually the same lake\Nwhere did that mountain come from
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.60,0:12:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,oh how strange wait that's\Nnot a mountain what the hell
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.62,0:12:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Shrororororororororororororororororororororoo
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.58,0:12:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Riley was the so-called\Nchemical weapon explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.06,0:12:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That occurred four years ago\Nright here on Punk Hazard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.04,0:12:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they seriously believe I would purify\Nthe island of my experiment entirely?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.40,0:12:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would be so wasteful?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.90,0:12:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, instead I created a monster\Nby compressing all the gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.78,0:12:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And it lives here still. My\Nsmiley, yes, punk, acid became
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.06,0:13:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,uninhabitable a Wasteland covered\Nwith a blanket of death the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.10,0:13:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,poisonous threat seemed to\NDisappear with my arrival in truth
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.76,0:13:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,it's been lingering here all\Nalong waiting to Be unleashed?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.46,0:13:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.58,0:13:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We got their ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.34,0:13:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them get out to sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.38,0:13:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish them off!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.72,0:13:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's end this quickly! Smoker!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.12,0:13:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what I'm doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.64,0:13:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How do I turn back?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.82,0:13:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You're getting in the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.46,0:13:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stay still for right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.54,0:13:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.98,0:13:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Get that door open!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.28,0:13:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That rat is hiding out in his lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.58,0:13:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't exterminate him\Nall the way out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.46,0:13:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use, Smokey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.02,0:13:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The door won't budge. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.42,0:13:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.64,0:13:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I were in my own body,\NI could get inside there easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.70,0:13:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead, I'm stuck like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.30,0:14:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That was awesome. Your power is\Nsuper cool. Did we just teleport?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.14,0:14:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up and stay inside the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.32,0:14:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We've almost reached the back door of the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.32,0:14:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,lab they should be\Nworking in the main room.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.18,0:14:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar and probably that\Nbird woman here's what
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.18,0:14:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We do try to find a way to\Nget them out of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.76,0:14:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,While we're gone, you look around and\Nsee what you can learn about the drug.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.52,0:14:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.04,0:14:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like you've got pretty\Neasy access to the Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.92,0:14:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And your
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.08,0:14:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,power is strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.00,0:14:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be simpler to\Ngo ahead and capture him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.84,0:14:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'd have plenty
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.68,0:14:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,of time to find out about the drug.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.80,0:14:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take him down myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.50,0:14:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There are certain circumstances
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.58,0:15:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,preventing that, which\Nis why I involved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.64,0:15:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to know the specifics.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.74,0:15:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All All I'm asking your\Ncrew to do is kidnap him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.78,0:15:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.00,0:15:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.08,0:15:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Look over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.98,0:15:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the hell is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.96,0:15:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's headed right for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.70,0:15:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it some kind of missile?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.00,0:15:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's not a missile!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.20,0:15:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, the end flow. Weep!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.20,0:15:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.60,0:15:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It talked!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.64,0:15:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But missiles can't talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.28,0:16:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.76,0:16:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Killer shortcut there, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.32,0:16:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Or else we'll break into your lab\Nbefore we kick your ass and kidnap you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.16,0:16:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, that was supposed\Nto be secret, him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.64,0:16:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.55,0:16:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the straw hair crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.47,0:16:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Luffy, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.58,0:16:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn loudmouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.42,0:16:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you capable of doing anything quietly?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.42,0:16:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you, master?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.40,0:16:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.40,0:17:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey guys, did that bastard just say he's\Ngonna kick our master's ass and kidnap him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.28,0:17:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, like hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.78,0:17:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Down with the saw hats, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.86,0:17:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ghostrun...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.18,0:17:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.44,0:17:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.35,0:17:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,How long do you think we'll\Nhave to wait for the master?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.44,0:17:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt he intends to\Nwalk out and greet us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.42,0:17:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.84,0:17:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.75,0:17:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we look for him in the laboratory?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.96,0:17:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.02,0:17:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That door over there is\Nprobably the entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.96,0:17:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.87,0:17:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall we go? Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.36,0:17:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.32,0:17:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.54,0:17:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What is your crew doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.24,0:17:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Why so mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.40,0:17:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He looked better than I thought\Nyou would last time I saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.06,0:17:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You were I'm getting beat up pretty bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.10,0:17:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop messing with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.74,0:18:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.72,0:18:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Constipated or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.30,0:18:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You feel like gassy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.64,0:18:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.36,0:18:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't used to be this weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.70,0:18:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something happen to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.74,0:18:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off of me! Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.60,0:18:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just weak, you sound different too,\Nalmost like you're a girl or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.34,0:18:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Toshiki, do me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.72,0:18:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get your ass kicked by an idiot\Nlike him while you're in my body, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.88,0:18:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.60,0:18:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy, back at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.40,0:18:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Causing trouble. Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.82,0:18:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here now to put an end to your fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.00,0:19:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap! I got hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.58,0:19:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The things tip with Z-prisms don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.28,0:19:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.76,0:19:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that lady captain with the glasses!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.20,0:19:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,She gets so strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.50,0:19:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.18,0:19:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The name's Smoker, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.90,0:19:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.10,0:19:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,They're both victims of lost little trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.88,0:19:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the whole shovel thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.96,0:19:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, that explains why he was so weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.78,0:19:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So this girl is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.90,0:19:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.42,0:19:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice luck, Smokey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.66,0:19:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so funny, you little maggot?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.52,0:19:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No more dodging! Come fight me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.90,0:19:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Second gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.86,0:19:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's moving too fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.60,0:20:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll finish this another time, Kay. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.80,0:20:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather fight you when you\Ncan use all your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.52,0:20:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's more fun that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.02,0:20:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need charity.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.62,0:20:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We fight now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.82,0:20:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.10,0:20:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.20,0:20:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And go Radical Bee!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.76,0:20:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He blasted a hole in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.74,0:20:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How strong are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.74,0:20:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that a laser?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.64,0:20:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.16,0:20:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The lab door's open now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.98,0:20:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go in and say hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.34,0:20:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Woohoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.34,0:20:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to use that laser! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.40,0:20:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Smokey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.31,0:20:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something strange\Nflying at us, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.66,0:20:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.90,0:20:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.92,0:21:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that? The ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.66,0:21:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, Franky, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.16,0:21:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.58,0:21:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's getting harder to breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.92,0:21:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Poison gas, Jordan, heal it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.14,0:21:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It started leaking after we cut it\Nopen and filled it with bullet holes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.32,0:21:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We need our gas masks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.20,0:21:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.84,0:21:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.88,0:21:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That looks crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.40,0:21:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.24,0:21:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it's some kind of monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.18,0:21:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It moves on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.32,0:21:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, where did that\Nthing come from? I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.80,0:21:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.58,0:22:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.60,0:22:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It just came falling out of the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.14,0:22:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and now it's all over the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.62,0:22:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, it's disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.06,0:22:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's got eyes that means\Nit's some creature right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.66,0:22:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey look the blobs are\Nmerging it's getting bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.38,0:22:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet it can't swim let's\Ntry pushing it into water.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.46,0:22:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure that's a good idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.16,0:22:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's leaking gas again!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.88,0:22:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.88,0:22:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.84,0:22:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.75,0:22:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.50,0:22:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.41,0:23:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's on my skin!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.00,0:23:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody get it off! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.08,0:23:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We need some cloth!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.60,0:23:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.51,0:23:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew we shouldn't\Nhave touched that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.30,0:23:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.56,0:23:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How should I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.22,0:23:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got this, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.24,0:23:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay back we haven't seen if\Nit likes fire yet have we?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.80,0:23:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I say we give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.76,0:23:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing in the world\Nthat's not afraid of fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.88,0:23:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Good idea. Smart gun the sucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.70,0:23:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill this slime monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.06,0:23:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't be long now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.46,0:23:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Things gotta be hurting right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.34,0:23:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting to burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.58,0:24:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No, damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.10,0:24:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So, anyone know what that thing is?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.80,0:24:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Some kind of slimy blob monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.54,0:24:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Touch it and spears boys\Nand burn it and it explodes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.22,0:24:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.38,0:24:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Or was it alive in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.74,0:24:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.32,0:24:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gone now, right? Yeah. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.30,0:24:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.44,0:24:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,More than good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.70,0:24:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That explosion saved\Nus the trouble of going
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.22,0:24:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,after the navy bastards\Nwho stole our ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.86,0:24:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It did us a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.76,0:24:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.90,0:24:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There's more!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.98,0:24:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Going this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.22,0:25:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Falling out of the sky like before!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.34,0:25:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How many are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.12,0:25:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out! There's one coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.74,0:25:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.12,0:25:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him touch you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.90,0:25:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Smoker, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.42,0:25:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous to stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.26,0:25:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat and find cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.08,0:25:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Good boy, I'm sorry I had to keep\Nyou locked up for three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.18,0:25:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, you should go, sir.\NIt isn't safe here now?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.50,0:25:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.02,0:25:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It is Caesar Clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.68,0:25:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the one behind this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.58,0:25:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the master?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.10,0:25:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.10,0:26:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.84,0:26:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Master of Punk Hazard!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.12,0:26:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Pirates and Marines of\Nthe Navy G5, welcome to my island!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.82,0:26:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to present the most\Nbrilliant scientist ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.24,0:26:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Caesar Clown!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.84,0:26:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A bit of patience, it won't be long.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.54,0:26:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't tolerate\Nwater very well, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.80,0:26:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So in order to cross the lake, he has\Nto fling himself over piece by piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.46,0:26:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Inconvenient, perhaps,\Nbut effective nonetheless.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.36,0:26:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,From a land of blazing fire\Nto a land of sparkling ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.26,0:26:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,In a few minutes, he will be fully\Nreassembled on this side of the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.16,0:26:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, boys and girls,\Nthe show will begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.04,0:27:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A recreation of the explosion from four\Nyears ago, and you have front row seats!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.28,0:27:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, prepare for destruction on a scale\Nthat you've never witnessed before!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.36,0:27:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So is it, uh, living? I have\Nno clue. I've never seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.16,0:27:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,anything like it this is\Nsuch a shocking sight?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.60,0:27:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My eyes might pop out of my head
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.26,0:27:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,no they won't but i haven't got any
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.88,0:27:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Well whatever it is it's strange
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.32,0:27:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,whatever it's doing is even stranger!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.94,0:28:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you now, Master!
